Juice Shop's source is not vendored here. `src/markers.mjs` contains a port of
`lib/codingChallenges.ts#getCodingChallengeFromFileContent` and `src/rsn.mjs` a
port of `rsn/rsnUtil.ts#computeDiffs`, both kept deliberately literal so that
this repository's output can be checked against upstream's rather than merely
resemble it. Both are used under the MIT licence above.

